    "description": "Hermes is a lightweight, plugin-driven spacecraft commanding and telemetry processing framework built on mature open-source software, developed at NASA JPL. It provides command completion, validation and dispatch inside Visual Studio Code; an extensible pipeline for processing flight-software downlink; storage in a variety of telemetry databases; and Grafana integration for display. It supports F Prime out of the box, with XTCE dictionary support and a YAMCS bridge.",
